    "content" : "Proof. One has to impose d1,1 = 0 and dp,j = 0 in eq. (5.7). Then, coefficients ωi,j vanish, because all the successive commutators [K(h),...,[K(h), K(h)]...] appearing in the BCH formula applied to eK(h) e K(h) contain only pure imaginary terms up to order O(h2p+1) ."
